+    /* IFileDialog::Show is modal: the owner is disabled for the duration and
+     * re-enabled when the dialog returns. The non-portal path gets that from the
+     * dialog manager; this path has to do it itself.
+     *
+     * Pumping the owner's message loop keeps the application repainting, but
+     * without disabling it the application also keeps *accepting input* -- menus,
